ularity rose by more than the threshold, the communities are then merged into the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"next level’s vertices, numbered by their labels in the partition just reported. At the first"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"level the level vertices are the graph’s vertices, numbered in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order (their vertex"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"indices when the graph has them). The method ends after a level whose modularity did not rise"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"enough, or after an aggregation whose local moving moved nothing."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/documentation\/CommunityDetection\/LouvainEvent\/aggregate(vertexCount:)","doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/documentation\/CommunityDetection\/LouvainEvent\/levelFinished(_:modularity:)","doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/documentation\/CommunityDetection\/LouvainEvent\/move(_:from:to:gain:)"],"title":"Enumeration Cases","generated":true,"anchor":"Enumeration-Cases"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/documentation\/CommunityDetection\/LouvainEvent\/CustomStringConvertible-Implementations","doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/documentation\/CommunityDetection\/LouvainEvent\/Equatable-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/SQ","doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/CommunityDetection\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/communitydetection\/louvainevent"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"s